# text = You can't do it too soon Now , as I came down to-day , I found that your friend , Mr Doyce , is looking for a partner in his business -- not a partner in his mechanical knowledge , but in the ways and means of turning the business arising from it to the best account Just so Mr Doyce mentioned incidentally , in the course of our conversation , that he was going to take your valuable advice on the subject of finding such a partner .
