# text = So , one day she stopped the coachman a little way from the cottage , and got out and walked on and peeped in at the door , and there , as usual , was the tiny woman spinning at her wheel , and she looked at the Princess , and the Princess looked at her Like trying to stare one another out Please go on , Little Mother The Princess was such a wonderful Princess that she had the power of knowing secrets , and she said to the tiny woman , Why do you keep it there ?
