# text = But you know what a dear , devoted mother she is , and you will remember her too ; will you not And , dear Mr Clennam because papa and one whom I need not name , do not fully appreciate and understand one another yet , as they will by-and-by ; and because it will be the duty , and the pride , and pleasure of my new life , to draw them to a better knowledge of one another , and to be a happiness to one another , and to be proud of one another , and to love one another , both loving me so dearly ; oh , as you are a kind , true man ! when I am first separated from home ( I am going a long distance away ), try to reconcile papa to him a little more , and use your great influence to keep him before papa's mind free from prejudice and in his real form .
